  "id": "chicken-kiev",
  "name": "Chicken Kiev",
  "subtitle": "Crisp breaded chicken with a seasoned butter center",
  "description": "Chicken breasts are filled with garlic butter, breaded, chilled briefly, and fried until crisp and safely cooked. Serve with lemon and parsley.",
